/-! # Exact polynomial exclusion certificate for nonmidpoint preimages

All coefficients are rational. Each nonnegative block is verified by an
explicit sum of squares, and the final identity is checked by `ring`.
No external algebra or numerical solver is trusted by these proofs.
-/

