    multiplier8 e f g h n c a b * constraint8 e f g h n c a b +
    multiplier9 e f g h n c a b * constraint9 e f g h n c a b) = 0 := by
  unfold total block0 block1 block2 block3 block4 block5 block6 block7 block8 block9 block10
    block11 multiplier0 multiplier1 multiplier2 multiplier3 multiplier4 multiplier5 multiplier6
    multiplier7 multiplier8 multiplier9 constraint0 constraint1 constraint2 constraint3
